          "code": "// @whimtex-effect Samples/Solar Corona\r\n// @control(_Opacity)\r\n// @param hidden float _Opacity = 1 [0 .. 1]\r\n// @param float _Radius = 0.3275 [0.1 .. 0.38]\r\n// @param float _Reach = 0.0677 [0.02 .. 0.16]\r\n// @param float _Turbulence = 0.148 [0 .. 1]\r\n\r\nfloat4 ApplyFX(float2 uv,float4 color){\r\n    float r=length(uv-.5);float a=atan2(uv.y-.5,uv.x-.5);\r\n    float n=color.r;\r\n    float spoke=.5+.25*sin(a*47+sin(a*13)*2)+.25*sin(a*91+1.3);\r\n    float reach=_Reach*lerp(1,.65+.35*spoke,_Turbulence);\r\n    float outside=max(r-_Radius,0);\r\n    float glow=exp(-pow(outside/max(reach*.48,.001),1.25));\r\n    float alpha=glow*lerp(1,.7+.3*n,_Turbulence)*(1-smoothstep(.445,.49,r));\r\n    float3 tint=lerp(float3(1,.49,.06),float3(1,.055,.001),saturate(outside/_Reach));\r\n    return float4(tint,alpha*_Opacity);\r\n}\r\n",
